    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wiggs et al. (1997), Li et al. (2011) & Eskandari et al. (2015) cylindrical bilayer mucosal folding, period-doubling & Poiseuille airway resistance — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the cylindrical bilayer circumferential mode selection law m* = c_cyl*(R_0/h_m)*(3*mu_s/mu_m)^(1/3) (L146-162), inextensible perimeter lumen-area occlusion and Hagen-Poiseuille resistance amplification (L165-180), and a nonlinear L-BFGS-B ring buckling + period-doubling and sulcal creasing energy minimizer (`relax_cylindrical_mucosal_ring`, L187-357), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_068_airway_mucosal_creasing.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wiggs et al. (1997), Li et al. (2011) & Eskandari et al. (2015) cylindrical bilayer mucosal folding, period-doubling & Poiseuille airway resistance — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L626-718) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: 12-point 3-species wavenumber Pearson r = 0.9986 (p = 8.9e-14, RMSE = 0.72 folds), log-log inverse thickness exponent alpha = -1.0449 ± 0.0177 (ref -1.0), Healthy m* = 13.38 (ref 14.04), Bronchitis m* = 8.43 (ref 8.99), Severe Asthma m* = 4.41 (ref 4.98), Severe Asthma Poiseuille resistance amplification R_flow/R0 = 15.65x (ref 16.52x), Relaxed ASM control area fraction 1.0000 (ref 1.0), specimen fold count m_obs = 13 (ref 13), and specimen circularity = 0.3981 (ref 0.40)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-12-point-3-species-bronchial-fold-wavenumber-scaling-correlation-human-bovine-ovine>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-chronic-bronchitis-remodeled-circumferential-fold-mode-number-m>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-healthy-thin-walled-bronchiole-circumferential-fold-mode-number-m>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-histology-specimen-segmented-inward-mucosal-fold-count-m-obs-bronchiole-mucosal-rosette-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-histology-specimen-segmented-rosette-lumen-circularity-4-pi-a-p-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-log-log-inverse-mucosal-thickness-scaling-exponent-alpha-m-h-m-r-0-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-relaxed-asm-negative-control-epsilon-theta-0-open-lumen-area-fraction-a-lumen-a-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-severe-asthma-hagen-poiseuille-airflow-resistance-amplification-r-flow-r-0-at-epsilon-theta-0-28>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-severe-asthmatic-airway-remodeling-circumferential-fold-mode-number-m>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wiggs et al. (1997), Li et al. (2011) & Eskandari et al. (2015) cylindrical bilayer mucosal folding, period-doubling & Poiseuille airway resistance — MorphoEval overall 93.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py` (overall weighted score: 93.4/100, up from 56.1/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a nonlinear cylindrical bilayer Föppl-von Kármán / neo-Hookean ring energy functional via L-BFGS-B with post-buckling period-doubling (m -> m/2) and sulcal creasing across Relaxed ASM Control (m=0, R_flow/R0=1.00), Healthy Bronchiole (m*=13.38, R_flow/R0=4.50), Chronic Bronchitis (m*=8.43, R_flow/R0=5.80), and Severe Asthma (m*=4.41, R_flow/R0=15.65); reproduces the 12-point 3-species wavenumber collapse across Human, Bovine, and Ovine airways (r = 0.9986, log-log exponent alpha = -1.0449 ± 0.0177); and segments the SHA-256-locked CC BY-SA 2.0 bronchiole histology specimen (`bronchiole_mucosal_rosette_specimen.jpg`, m_obs = 13 folds, circularity = 0.3981). Overall 93.3/100 (faithfulness 93.0, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/airway_mucosal_creasing_comparison.png: rendered output of 2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py at e93f00e, image/png, 929101 B, 2119×1412 px, artifact_sha256 a9e197162282ea60d53488163dec38011ccf6f089b42215cdd1a4457e149cd2e (sha256 a9e197162282ea60d53488163dec38011ccf6f089b42215cdd1a4457e149cd2e), spec_fingerprint 05e3af78f585432603f642410d2578bbd795537fd20203d0ce320ae7253e2a7e. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 05e3af78f585432603f642410d2578bbd795537fd20203d0ce320ae7253e2a7e; artifact_sha256: a9e197162282ea60d53488163dec38011ccf6f089b42215cdd1a4457e149cd2e; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/airway_mucosal_creasing_reference.json=de50bdef15ba022d..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/bronchiole_mucosal_rosette_specimen.jpg=ecdf9c611a8c6f1c..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/paper_citations.bib=dc5cda198aa48e19..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/scout_manifest.json=c73a19386245eae3...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-airway-mucosal-creasing-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 1D circumferential bilayer ring solver to a 3D branching bronchial tree airway impedance network to simulate heterogeneous ventilation defects during asthmatic bronchospasm." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.33e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

